---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>

  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION WITH LEAD FORM -->
  <section class="bg-[#F3F6F9] py-6 md:py-10 px-4 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Side: Text & Trust Badges -->
      <div class="text-center lg:text-left pt-2 lg:pt-0">
        <span class="bg-red-100 text-kent-red px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-wide uppercase mb-4 inline-block border border-red-200 animate-pulse">
          🚨 60-Min Doorstep Arrival in Bangalore
        </span>
        
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
          Top-Rated <span class="text-kent-blue">Water Purifier Service</span> & RO Repair
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 text-base md:text-lg text-justify">
          Is your RO leaking, making noise, or giving bad taste? Get Bangalore's most trusted water purifier service today. We repair all major brands at your doorstep in 60 minutes with 100% genuine spare parts and a 90-day warranty. <strong class="text-gray-900 font-bold">Doorstep visit and diagnosis is just <span class="text-kent-red font-extrabold text-xl">₹299</span> <span class="text-sm font-bold text-green-600">(waived off if repaired)</span>.</strong>
        </p>
        
        <ul class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-700 font-medium space-y-3 mb-2 lg:mb-8 text-left inline-block w-full max-w-md mx-auto lg:mx-0">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">✔</span>
            <span>Certified Experts for All Brands</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">✔</span>
            <span>Free TDS & Leakage Diagnosis</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">✔</span>
            <span>90-Day Warranty on Spare Parts</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="hidden lg:flex gap-4 mt-2">
          <a href="tel:08062180546" class="bg-kent-blue text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-kent-dark transition flex items-center gap-2">
            📞 Call Now
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/918062180546" class="bg-[#25D366] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold shadow-md hover:bg-green-600 transition flex items-center gap-2">
            💬 WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Side: Lead Form -->
      <div id="booking-form" class="bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 relative mt-2 lg:mt-0">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 -right-3 bg-kent-red text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg">Book Now</div>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Book Your Appointment</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">Fill the form & our technician will call you in 5 mins.</p>
        
        <form id="bookingForm" class="space-y-4">
          
          <!-- FormSubmit Hidden Fields -->
          <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New RO Service Booking Request!">

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Name</label>
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-kent-blue focus:border-transparent transition">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Mobile</label>
              <input 
                type="tel" 
                name="mobile" 
                placeholder="10-Digit Mobile" 
                required 
                maxlength="10" 
                minlength="10" 
                pattern="[0-9]{10}" 
                title="Please enter exactly 10 digits"
                inputmode="numeric"
                class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-kent-blue focus:border-transparent transition"
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Pin Code</label>
              <input type="number" name="pincode" placeholder="560001" required class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-kent-blue focus:border-transparent transition">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Select Issue/Brand</label>
              <select name="brand" required class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-kent-blue focus:border-transparent transition bg-white">
                <option value="" disabled selected>Select Brand/Service...</option>
                <option value="Kent">Kent</option>
                <option value="Aquaguard">Aquaguard</option>
                <option value="Pureit">Pureit</option>
                <option value="AO Smith">AO Smith</option>
                <option value="LG">LG</option>
                <option value="Livpure">Livpure</option>
                <option value="Zero B">Zero B</option>
                <option value="Aqua Grand">Aqua Grand</option>
                <option value="Aqua Pearl">Aqua Pearl</option>
                <option value="Aqua Natural">Aqua Natural</option>
                <option value="Havells">Havells</option>
                <option value="V-Guard">V-Guard</option>
                <option value="Other">Other Brand</option>
                <option value="Installation">New Installation</option>
                <option value="Service">General Service</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Full Address</label>
            <textarea name="address" placeholder="Flat No, Building, Area..." rows="2" required class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-kent-blue focus:border-transparent transition"></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-kent-blue text-white font-bold text-lg py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-kent-dark shadow-md transition">
            Book Service Now
          </button>
          
          <p class="text-xs text-center text-gray-400 mt-2">No advance payment required.</p>
        </form>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. STATS & SERVICES SECTION -->
  <section id="services" class="py-10 bg-white border-b border-gray-100 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-kent-blue">12,560+</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-medium mt-1">Happy Customers</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-green-600">60 Mins</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-medium mt-1">Fastest Arrival</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-yellow-500">4.7 ⭐</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-medium mt-1">Google Rating</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-purple-600">90 Days</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-medium mt-1">Spare Warranty</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-blue-50 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-10">How It Works</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative">
        <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-kent-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-4 shadow-lg">1</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Book Online</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Fill the form or call us to book your service.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-kent-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-4 shadow-lg">2</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Technician Arrives</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Our expert reaches your home within 60 minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-kent-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mb-4 shadow-lg">3</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Relax & Drink Safe Water</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">We fix the issue on the spot with a warranty.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. PRICING / SERVICE CHARGES (Added ID) -->
  <section id="pricing" class="py-16 px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Transparent Service Packages</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Pay only for what you need. No hidden fees.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Card 1: Standard Service -->
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white shadow-sm hover:border-kent-blue transition">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Standard RO Service</h3>
        <div class="flex items-end gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-kent-blue">₹499</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">/ service</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Best for regular maintenance & bad taste issues.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li>✅ Complete Machine & Tank Cleaning</li>
          <li>✅ Sediment & Carbon Filter Checkup</li>
          <li>✅ Free TDS Level Testing</li>
          <li>✅ 30-Day Service Warranty</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#booking-form" class="block text-center w-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 font-bold py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-200 transition">Book Standard Service</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: AMC -->
      <div class="border-2 border-kent-blue rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white shadow-md relative mt-4 md:mt-0">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-kent-blue text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Best Value</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">1-Year Full AMC</h3>
        <div class="flex items-end gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-kent-blue">₹3,499</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">/ year</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">Hassle-free maintenance for the whole year.</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li>✅ Free Filter & Membrane Replacement</li>
          <li>✅ Unlimited Breakdown Calls</li>
          <li>✅ 3 Scheduled Service Checks</li>
          <li>✅ Zero Labor & Visit Charges</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#booking-form" class="block text-center w-full bg-kent-blue text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-kent-dark transition shadow-md">Get AMC Details</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. BRANDS SECTION -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-kent-blue px-4">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8">Expert Service for All Major Brands</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#" class="bg-white/10 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-kent-blue transition">Kent RO</a>
        <a href="#" class="bg-white/10 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-kent-blue transition">Aquaguard</a>
        <a href="#" class="bg-white/10 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-kent-blue transition">Pureit</a>
        <a href="#" class="bg-white/10 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-kent-blue transition">AO Smith</a>
        <a href="#" class="bg-white/10 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-kent-blue transition">LG</a>
        <a href="#" class="bg-white/10 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-kent-blue transition">Havells</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. BRAND DISCLAIMER -->
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 bg-white">
    <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 p-4 rounded-lg text-center shadow-sm">
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> 24x7 RO Support is an independent, third-party multi-brand RO water purifier repair and service center in Bangalore. Brand names & logos (Kent, Aquaguard, AO Smith, Pureit, LG, Havells, V-Guard, etc.) belong to their respective owners and are referenced solely for compatibility identification. We are not an authorized service partner of any brand.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 7. WHY CHOOSE US -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto bg-gray-50/50">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Bangalore's Most Trusted RO Service Center</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-base md:text-lg text-justify md:text-center">
        Searching for a reliable <strong>RO service center near you</strong>? We are Bangalore's leading independent water purifier repair experts. From fixing leaks to replacing filters, our certified technicians ensure your family gets 100% safe and pure drinking water.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-50 text-kent-blue rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-5">👨‍🔧</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Expert RO Technicians</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm text-justify md:text-center">
          Our background-verified professionals are trained to handle any <strong>water purifier repair</strong> issue on the spot, ensuring your RO is fixed right the first time.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-50 text-green-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-5">🛡️</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">100% Genuine Spares</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm text-justify md:text-center">
          We use only original RO spare parts with a 90-day warranty. Say goodbye to cheap, duplicate parts that break quickly and ruin your water quality.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-5">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Fast Doorstep Service</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm text-justify md:text-center">
          Need urgent RO service in Bangalore? Our service center dispatches technicians within 60 minutes to your location for quick diagnosis and repair.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8. LOCAL BANGALORE TDS ISSUE -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-blue-50 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Why Bangalore Water Ruins Your RO</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Bangalore's borewell and tanker water has very high TDS (Total Dissolved Solids). This causes filters to clog faster and damages the RO membrane.</p>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-red-100">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Unfiltered Tap Water</p>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-red-500 mb-2">650 - 1200+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">PPM (Unsafe & Hard)</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-green-100">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Our Purified Water</p>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-green-500 mb-2">50 - 150</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">PPM (Sweet & Safe)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 9. TESTIMONIALS -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto bg-white">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What Our Customers Say</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Real reviews from real people in Bangalore.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
        <div class="flex text-yellow-500 mb-3">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-4 italic">"My Kent RO was leaking badly. I booked them online and the technician arrived in just 45 minutes. Very professional service and reasonable price."</p>
        <div class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm">- Rahul S. (Whitefield)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
        <div class="flex text-yellow-500 mb-3">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-4 italic">"They changed the filter of my Aquaguard. The technician showed me the TDS level before and after. Water tastes so much better now."</p>
        <div class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm">- Priya M. (Koramangala)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
        <div class="flex text-yellow-500 mb-3">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-4 italic">"Best RO service in Bangalore. They use genuine spare parts and provide a warranty. Highly recommended for Pureit users."</p>
        <div class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm">- Amit K. (HSR Layout)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 10. SERVICE AREAS (Added ID) -->
  <section id="areas" class="py-12 bg-white px-4 text-center border-t border-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">We Serve All Areas in Bangalore</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Whitefield</span>
        <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Koramangala</span>
        <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">HSR Layout</span>
        <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Indiranagar</span>
        <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Electronic City</span>
        <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Jayanagar</span>
        <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Marathahalli</span>
        <span class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">BTM Layout</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 11. FAQs (Added ID) -->
  <section id="faq" class="py-16 bg-gray-50 px-4 border-t border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm" open>
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            How much does RO service cost in Bangalore?
            <span class="text-kent-blue group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Our standard service charge starts from ₹499. Basic diagnosis is free, and if you get the repair done with us, visit charges are waived off. Spare parts are charged separately.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            Do you use genuine spare parts?
            <span class="text-kent-blue group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Yes, we only use 100% original manufacturer spare parts (Kent, Aquaguard, etc.) with a 90-day warranty.</p>
        </details>
        
        <details class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            How fast can a technician reach my home?
            <span class="text-kent-blue group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">We usually reach within 60 minutes across major Bangalore areas. For outskirt areas, it might take slightly longer.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            How frequently should RO filters be replaced?
            <span class="text-kent-blue group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Due to high TDS in Bangalore water, we recommend replacing the sediment and carbon filters every 6 to 9 months to ensure the best water quality and motor life.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            Which brands do you provide service for?
            <span class="text-kent-blue group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">We are a multi-brand service center. We repair Kent, Aquaguard, Pureit, AO Smith, LG, Livpure, Zero B, Havells, V-Guard, and almost all other water purifier brands.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 cursor-pointer group shadow-sm">
          <summary class="font-bold text-gray-900 flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            Do I need to pay any advance amount for booking?
